%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb50b23a4cf2d8b458c5808c80931e04, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3DAYSLEFT BB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Dialogue.DialogueNode
  speakerName: Oryctola
  dialogueType: 0
  advanceDialogueDatabase: 1
  lines:
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Ah, Lepus, Lepus...
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'Truly telling that he hasn''t even filled you in. Was he in such a hurry
      to stop me? How did he think YOU could convince me to stop when you don''t
      even know the first thing about this sordid world? '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'Lepus is a fool. He and I, we... we used to be colleagues. We were the
      leading force of Bunnykind''s progress.

'
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'Scientists. Visionaries. '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Then, the disaster happened. The city failed, the Coalition of Syl we...
      well. Some of us died, others went off on their own. Me and Lepus tried to
      stand together.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: But he's just so... so nosey! He thought the answer lied within the disaster's
      origin, and I couldn't- well, I knew already that it didn't. I mean- it was
      obvious to everyone. He was wasting time.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'I was perhaps not graceful in letting him know.

'
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'And Lepus is way too sensitive. We fell out. Simple as. And now he''s
      out to destroy every bit of progress that I make. '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: a969c6cf5888b5e47b18c98739fba120, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Still feel like you're on the right side?
    typingSpeed: 1
  ChoicePortraits:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38a222d19b75354baf0ce9421ce6445, type: 3}
  ChoicePortraitAnimationFPS: 8
  choices:
  - text: Well, you're trying to kill everyone. So yes?
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a786de169d4efd546998e2edb26dfbc1, type: 2}
    conditions: []
    effects:
    - variable: 0
      operation: 1
      value: 1
    onSelected:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - text: I'm not convinced this "disaster" is impossible to overcome.
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89d1dc170b8d7e24f86a003f55a97464, type: 2}
    conditions:
    - variable: 0
      condition: 3
      value: 1
    effects:
    - variable: 0
      operation: 1
      value: 1
    onSelected:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  yesChoice:
    text: 
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    conditions: []
    effects: []
    onSelected:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  noChoice:
